# Repeatable SETBOMB 4 Tanker wall contacts: same reverse/forward hold each cycle.
# RAM windows include the 0x65a1e4 player globals and nearby game state; PPMs
# record each contact so car-damage bytes can be compared after the run.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80

17000 shot start
+100 down right
+256 up right
+100 down up
+1000 up up
+100 down left
+256 up left
+100 down up
+2100 up up
+100 down left
+256 up left
+100 down up
+1200 up up
+200 shot before_board_b
+50 tap enter 70
+2000 shot boarded_and_armed
+50 memdump bomb_armed 0x600000 0x100000

# Controlled approach and first contact with the east wall.
+100 down up
+800 up up
+500 shot before_impact_01
+100 down up
+350 up up
+0 burst impact_01 30 14
+500 memdump after_impact_01 0x600000 0x100000

# Back off and repeat the same forward hold four times.
+100 down up
+100 up down
+850 down down
+100 up up
+850 down up
+0 burst impact_02 30 14
+500 memdump after_impact_02 0x600000 0x100000

+100 down up
+100 up down
+850 down down
+100 up up
+850 down up
+0 burst impact_03 30 14
+500 memdump after_impact_03 0x600000 0x100000

+100 down up
+100 up down
+850 down down
+100 up up
+850 down up
+0 burst impact_04 30 14
+500 memdump after_impact_04 0x600000 0x100000

+100 down up
+100 up down
+850 down down
+100 up up
+850 down up
+0 burst impact_05 30 14
+500 memdump after_impact_05 0x600000 0x100000

+1000 shot after_contacts
+100 quit
